      "text": "For regulation 4.1.2, the following shall be substituted: '4.1.2 Ancillary Uses in R-Main: Ancillary commercial uses in Residential (Main) zone are permissible only in Ring I and Ring II on plots up to 240 sq.m abutting roads of 12.0 m width or more, restricted to 20 percent of built-up area or 50 sq.m whichever is less; in Ring III, commercial uses in R-Main require an 18.0 m road.'",
